    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Grunts: Chrono Shard is a combination of turn-based tactics and fast paced arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through procedurally generated space stations, taking out enemies or using the shockwave of your rockets, grenades and other explosions to simply move those enemies out of the way on your path to the end goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/c0a5c90bc868b6f5131f1c7606755de2.poster.avif?t=1754470008\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/c0a5c90bc868b6f5131f1c7606755de2.webm?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/c0a5c90bc868b6f5131f1c7606755de2.mp4?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ooze has been spreading throughout the galaxy (also see OrangePixel's Residual) and using a network of HyperGates to infect more and more planets, space stations, and anything else it could reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientist have invented the <strong>Chrono Device</strong> which allows the Space Grunts tactical unit to place an area in a time-bubble, allowing them to close the malfunctioning HyperGate and stop the Ooze from spreading to new areas in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grunt carries a <strong>Chrono Shard</strong> which allows them to loop time in case of dying and place items that are also linked to the Chrono Device and will remain in place when time loops around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chrono time - allowing you to replay a level when you die, while items placed and changes made in the level in previous attempts remain in tact for the retry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast turn-based gameplay (as seen and enjoyed in the original Space Grunts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical weapon usage with weapons having a &quot;spread pattern&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive weapons generate shock-waves pushing/forcing entities around the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.poster.avif?t=1754470008\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.webm?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.mp4?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chrono Shard is currently in &quot;early stages&quot; of development, you can follow it's development on the Orangepixel Youtube channel, where I frequently post update videos and, hop on the Discord where I frequently ask for feedback and show early new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.poster.avif?t=1754470008\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.webm?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.mp4?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Space Grunts: Chrono Shard is a combination of turn-based tactics and fast paced arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through procedurally generated space stations, taking out enemies or using the shockwave of your rockets, grenades and other explosions to simply move those enemies out of the way on your path to the end goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/c0a5c90bc868b6f5131f1c7606755de2.poster.avif?t=1754470008\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/c0a5c90bc868b6f5131f1c7606755de2.webm?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/c0a5c90bc868b6f5131f1c7606755de2.mp4?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ooze has been spreading throughout the galaxy (also see OrangePixel's Residual) and using a network of HyperGates to infect more and more planets, space stations, and anything else it could reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scientist have invented the <strong>Chrono Device</strong> which allows the Space Grunts tactical unit to place an area in a time-bubble, allowing them to close the malfunctioning HyperGate and stop the Ooze from spreading to new areas in the galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grunt carries a <strong>Chrono Shard</strong> which allows them to loop time in case of dying and place items that are also linked to the Chrono Device and will remain in place when time loops around.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chrono time - allowing you to replay a level when you die, while items placed and changes made in the level in previous attempts remain in tact for the retry</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast turn-based gameplay (as seen and enjoyed in the original Space Grunts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical weapon usage with weapons having a &quot;spread pattern&quot; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explosive weapons generate shock-waves pushing/forcing entities around the map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.poster.avif?t=1754470008\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.webm?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/db6008997fd5666215894bb49eaf03f5.mp4?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chrono Shard is currently in &quot;early stages&quot; of development, you can follow it's development on the Orangepixel Youtube channel, where I frequently post update videos and, hop on the Discord where I frequently ask for feedback and show early new features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.poster.avif?t=1754470008\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.webm?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/46d2ab5ddafc5db6ee47d8da683fd80d.mp4?t=1754470008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You have an X amount of turns before all hell breaks loose. Gain experience and new items to find ways to prolong the inevitable while you complete missions on board of space ships, moon bases and other mysterious areas in space. One step at a time in this fast paced but turn based roguelike.",
